# Walk to the controlled police car using the known south-flank entry path,
# then accelerate along the city street to capture the camera's speed response.
3500 tap esc 80
+2000 tap enter 80
+3000 tap enter 80
+1500 tap enter 80

17000 down left
+256 up left
+100 shot camera_facing_north
+100 down up
+1000 up up
+150 shot camera_at_cop
+100 burst enter_cop 140 0
+30 tap enter 70
+2200 shot camera_start
+100 down up
+0 burst drive 180 0
+700 shot camera_700ms
+900 shot camera_1600ms
+900 shot camera_2500ms
+900 shot camera_3400ms
+900 shot camera_4300ms
+900 shot camera_5200ms
+100 up up
+200 shot camera_stop
+100 quit
